<% game = scene.game_session; budget = game.scene_budget; hero = scene.active_player %>Scene <%= scene.position %> of <%= budget %>, <%= hero.name %>'s turn.<% if hero.character.hp.zero? %> <%= hero.name %> has collapsed, their health spent. This scene is the finale and the story ends in defeat: pay off what was planted, then close.<% elsif scene.last? %> This scene is the finale and the story ends in <%= game.verdict %>: pay off the secret and what was planted, then close.<% elsif scene.first? %> Open the story in motion and decide the secret.<% elsif scene.position == budget - 1 %> The darkest hour: the cost comes due or the plan falls apart, right before the end.<% elsif scene.position == (budget / 2.0).ceil %> The turn: what the hero believed is wrong, and the secret shows its face.<% else %> Raise the stakes: pay for what came before, and let the one who stands in the way act.<% end %>
